---
---

<div class="rpg-what-i-do">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
      <div class="h-px flex-1 bg-accent-color opacity-30"></div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold whitespace-nowrap">My Arcane Arts</h2>
      <div class="h-px flex-1 bg-accent-color opacity-30"></div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <p class="text-md sm:text-lg text-muted leading-relaxed rpg-text">
        I command the <span class="font-semibold text-accent-color">Data Arcanum Guild</span> at LegalZoom, focusing my powers on crafting reliable, secure, and self-service data enchantments with mystical tools like Snowflake, Airflow, and the ancient runes of Terraform.
      </p>
      
      <p class="text-md sm:text-lg text-muted leading-relaxed rpg-text">
        My craft exists at the crossroads of <span class="italic">arcane engineering and empowerment</span> — forging reusable magical components and sturdy foundations for fellow mages to weave their spells with confidence and speed.
      </p>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-10">
        <div class="rpg-skill-card p-6 rounded-xl bg-bubble-bg border border-secondary-color hover:transform hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-accent-color bg-opacity-20 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-accent-color" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Arcane Architecture</h3>
          <p class="text-muted">I design magical systems that are elegantly simple, intuitively understood, and require minimal maintenance from their keepers.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="rpg-skill-card p-6 rounded-xl bg-bubble-bg border border-secondary-color hover:transform hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-secondary-color bg-opacity-20 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-secondary-color" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 9l3 3-3 3m5 0h3M5 20h14a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Artifact Crafting</h3>
          <p class="text-muted">I forge magical tools that fellow enchanters actually desire to wield. Clear grimoires, intuitive interfaces, fewer questions sent by raven.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="rpg-skill-card p-6 rounded-xl bg-bubble-bg border border-secondary-color hover:transform hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-tertiary-color bg-opacity-20 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-tertiary-color" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Guild Leadership</h3>
          <p class="text-muted">I support wise mages, clear obstacles from their path, and strive to keep the chaotic energies at bay.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .rpg-what-i-do {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
  }
  
  .rpg-what-i-do h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    text-shadow: 1px 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  }
  
  .rpg-what-i-do h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    color: var(--text-color);
  }
  
  .rpg-text {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  
  .rpg-text::first-letter {
    font-size: 1.5em;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: bold;
    color: var(--accent-color);
  }
  
  .rpg-skill-card {
    position: relative;
    background-image: var(--parchment-texture);
    border: 2px solid var(--secondary-color);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }
  
  .rpg-skill-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    border-color: var(--accent-color);
  }
  
  .rpg-skill-card::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    background-image: var(--border-decoration);
    background-size: 100% 100%;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0.3;
    z-index: 0;
  }
  
  .rpg-skill-card > * {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
</style>
